post_install() {
    cat <<'EOF'
==> Optional: run the Paseo daemon for your graphical session (desktop app
    and CLI will connect to it instead of spawning their own):
        systemctl --user enable --now paseo.service
    It is bound to graphical-session.target: it starts on login and stops on
    logout, so it inherits DISPLAY/WAYLAND_DISPLAY and agents can launch GUIs.
    Do NOT enable-linger for this; GUI agents need an active session.
EOF
}
